      "value": "Duplicate of (?):\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/world-local-animations-break-after-update\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/vrcstation-is-not-sitting-locking-players-on-remote-clients",
