  "details": "I am not sure how to explain this easily, so i created a video to demonstrate the issue:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ThL8dFD6hKY\n\nTo sum it up, stations do not anchor the seated player to the station anymore (it only does sometimes) and more than one player can sit in a station at once.\n\nThis breaks things like cars, or systems that rely on stations to \"change\" the players visual position to others.\n\nFrom what I've seen:\n\nPlayer enters station,\n\nOn remote end, that player appears in the correct spot in the station for a moment\n\nThat player then gets teleported on remote end to where they *actually* are\n\nRemote player can enter the station even though the other player is already sitting in it, which causes even more issues.",
